<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xml:lang="en-US"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml"
  xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"
  xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling">
  <head>
    <metadata xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata">
      <ttm:title>601132353 - 1_1idk4z76 - PID 1530551</ttm:title>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="basic" tts:textAlign="center" />
    </styling>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div style="basic">
        <p begin="00:00:01.480" end="00:00:04.160" tts:direction="ltr">For this first unit,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:04.160" end="00:00:07.520" tts:direction="ltr">we're going to be really just getting
<br />ourselves familiar with Excel.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:07.520" end="00:00:11.560" tts:direction="ltr">Some of you may use Excel on a daily
<br />basis,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:11.560" end="00:00:12.960" tts:direction="ltr">and for some of you, this may be</p>
        <p begin="00:00:12.960" end="00:00:16.200" tts:direction="ltr">your first time ever working in a
<br />spreadsheet.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:16.200" end="00:00:19.320" tts:direction="ltr">What we're going to be doing over the next
<br />two weeks is to</p>
        <p begin="00:00:19.320" end="00:00:22.680" tts:direction="ltr">really get ourselves acquainted with the
<br />language of Excel.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:22.680" end="00:00:26.520" tts:direction="ltr">What can we do just basically to
<br />manipulate data?</p>
        <p begin="00:00:26.520" end="00:00:27.720" tts:direction="ltr">How do we sort data?</p>
        <p begin="00:00:27.720" end="00:00:31.180" tts:direction="ltr">How refer to each of the cells,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:31.180" end="00:00:34.540" tts:direction="ltr">is the intersection of a row and a column.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:34.540" end="00:00:37.060" tts:direction="ltr">What is a worksheet? What's a workbook?</p>
        <p begin="00:00:37.060" end="00:00:42.380" tts:direction="ltr">These are all vocabulary that you're going
<br />to need to be familiar</p>
        <p begin="00:00:42.380" end="00:00:48.780" tts:direction="ltr">with to really be successful when using
<br />spreadsheets, specifically, Excel.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:48.780" end="00:00:52.220" tts:direction="ltr">For this first practice assignment,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:52.220" end="00:00:58.590" tts:direction="ltr">you're going to really just be working
<br />really high level in Excel.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:58.590" end="00:01:01.230" tts:direction="ltr">Then for your second practice,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:01.230" end="00:01:07.030" tts:direction="ltr">you're going to continue to add new
<br />vocabulary and new formatting.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:07.030" end="00:01:09.550" tts:direction="ltr">How do we highlight ourselves,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:09.550" end="00:01:12.070" tts:direction="ltr">certain colors? What can we do with it?</p>
        <p begin="00:01:12.070" end="00:01:15.350" tts:direction="ltr">And then finally in our third practice for
<br />this week,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:15.350" end="00:01:18.150" tts:direction="ltr">you're going to be learning how to sort
<br />data.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:18.150" end="00:01:20.870" tts:direction="ltr">Now, all of this seems pretty
<br />straightforward,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:20.870" end="00:01:24.470" tts:direction="ltr">but it really is the foundational building
<br />blocks that you need.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:24.470" end="00:01:27.750" tts:direction="ltr">Things like sorting are what I use.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:27.750" end="00:01:32.750" tts:direction="ltr">I do in Excel pretty much every time I
<br />open the program.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:32.750" end="00:01:38.150" tts:direction="ltr">I really like to use the formatting
<br />features in order to make sure</p>
        <p begin="00:01:38.150" end="00:01:40.790" tts:direction="ltr">that I'm drawing people's attention</p>
        <p begin="00:01:40.790" end="00:01:44.150" tts:direction="ltr">to what's really important within our
<br />data.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:44.150" end="00:01:46.590" tts:direction="ltr">These are all going to be really critical
<br />ideas.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:46.590" end="00:01:52.990" tts:direction="ltr">What you'll do this week is you will
<br />complete the three practice sets,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:52.990" end="00:01:57.420" tts:direction="ltr">then you will Go ahead and next week,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:57.420" end="00:02:02.780" tts:direction="ltr">you'll be doing your first concept and
<br />context assignment,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:02.780" end="00:02:06.820" tts:direction="ltr">which is where I will be walking through a
<br />lot more of the why behind things.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:06.820" end="00:02:11.260" tts:direction="ltr">The practice problems do a really great
<br />job at introducing the vocabulary,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:11.260" end="00:02:14.100" tts:direction="ltr">the really technical foundations.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:14.100" end="00:02:19.900" tts:direction="ltr">Then you'll put it more into practice and
<br />take a step back and say,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:19.900" end="00:02:21.540" tts:direction="ltr">Okay, why does this matter?</p>
        <p begin="00:02:21.540" end="00:02:26.460" tts:direction="ltr">Then you'll also have your assessment and
<br />both the concept and</p>
        <p begin="00:02:26.460" end="00:02:32.355" tts:direction="ltr">context lesson and the assessment are all
<br />due in the following week.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:32.355" end="00:02:35.050" tts:direction="ltr">Be sure you're doing the textbook
<br />readings,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:35.050" end="00:02:38.650" tts:direction="ltr">be sure you're asking questions in our
<br />discussion board,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:38.650" end="00:02:43.170" tts:direction="ltr">and this will just be a really great
<br />introduction</p>
        <p begin="00:02:43.170" end="00:02:47.890" tts:direction="ltr">to Excel and the expectations of how class
<br />is going to go.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:47.890" end="00:02:49.410" tts:direction="ltr">Thank you. Good luck.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:49.410" end="00:02:50.690" tts:direction="ltr">Keep me updated.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:50.690" end="00:02:53.730" tts:direction="ltr">Let me know how it's going for you and how
<br />I can help make</p>
        <p begin="00:02:53.730" end="00:02:58.010" tts:direction="ltr">this as meaningful of an experience for
<br />you as possible.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:58.010" end="00:03:00.130" tts:direction="ltr">Good luck.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
